  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our changing rooms change lives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When difficulty comes your way, who do you turn to?  When Anita walked through our doors she had lost her confidence. She had been out of work for 13 years, had gone through a relationship breakdown, and was struggling in a job market which had changed dramatically in her absence.  We were the main connection for Anita as she sought support to rebuild her life.  To help more women like Anita to get a job that can provide a safe, secure future for their family, we need your support!</narrative>
  </description>
